   116	the chart: `Δ` alone does not satisfy the system; `Δ` cut by the `h2`-only rows
   117	does. The theorem is correctly stated about `Δ_T`, and I record that the raw
   118	coordinate subspace `Δ` is *not* a solution locus — a reader who takes the
   119	headline "`Δ` satisfies every row" literally will be wrong on three rows at
   120	`T = 8` alone.
