+Proposal 1A: impose the actual D2 characteristic face before expanding ambient equations. In characteristic zero, under CD's monic Keller setup and actual D2 faces, put \(R=T_2^\psi(F,G)\). M Prop.2.2 and CD:53–79 license
+
+\[
+R=G^3-F^2+aG^2+bFG+cF+dG+e_0,\quad
+\deg R=D_2,\quad \operatorname{lc}_y R=\lambda\ne0.
