+**Q1. Reduce the attainment chart, not its required depth.**
+
+Proposal 1A: impose the actual D2 characteristic face before expanding ambient equations. In characteristic zero, under CD's monic Keller setup and actual D2 faces, put \(R=T_2^\psi(G,F)\), in Moh's argument order. M Prop.2.2 and CD:53–79 license
