+\[
+q_{99}/C=\pi-4\pi^4+\tfrac{48}{7}\pi^7-\tfrac{216}{35}\pi^{10}
++\tfrac{1296}{455}\pi^{13}-\tfrac{243}{455}\pi^{16},
+\]
+\[
+q_{108}/C=\pi-\tfrac{21}{5}\pi^5+\tfrac{112}{15}\pi^9
+-\tfrac{448}{65}\pi^{13}+\tfrac{3584}{1105}\pi^{17}
+-\tfrac{2048}{3315}\pi^{21}.
